          "word": "area.",
          "start": 3315.055,
          "end": 3315.481,
          "speaker": "Catherine"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And after the first meeting, I, I remember driving back to, to the hospital, and I don't even remember the drive back.",
