          "speaker": "Catherine"
        },
        {
          "word": "here.",
          "start": 3468.93,
          "end": 3469.33,
          "speaker": "Catherine"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "I can't wait.",
      "start": 3470.0,
      "end": 3471.098,
      "speaker": "Catherine",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": "I",
          "start": 3470.0,
          "end": 3470.366,
          "speaker": "Catherine"
        },
        {
          "word": "can't",
          "start": 3470.366,
          "end": 3470.732,
          "speaker": "Catherine"
        },
        {
          "word": "wait.",
          "start": 3470.732,
          "end": 3471.098,
          "speaker": "Catherine"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "As tired as I am on Fridays when I get home and I think \"oh my gosh, I wonder if I'm gonna get there tonight.\"",
      "start": 3471.098,
      "end": 3477.306,
