        },
        {
          "word": "affected",
          "start": 3555.109,
          "end": 3555.497,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "me.",
          "start": 3555.497,
          "end": 3555.885,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "I'll always, I have to confess, think of it as with difficulty there is relief.",
