        },
        {
          "word": "mosquitoes.",
          "start": 3592.334,
          "end": 3592.62,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "There was pain, laughter, and reverence, all at the same time.",
